    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what you mean about the tension, but it feels like there's a real decline in quality. like, if you look at a lot of the big installations in major museums lately, they seem more like lecture notes than actual art. don't you think the focus on \"social correction\" has basically killed the pursuit of technical mastery and beauty in the art world?",
